    Usage -</size></align>

    Isolate <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>Infected Villagers</i></size></color>
    for 2 In-game Days to gather the Virus DNA and attempt a cure in the <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>Laboratory</i></size></color>. '
